Image="*‮*" CommandLine IN ("*‮*", "*\\u202e*", "*U+202E*", "*%E2%80%AE*") Image IN ("*\\Users\\*", "*\\Downloads\\*", "*\\Desktop\\*", "*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*\\Public\\*") OR ParentImage IN ("*\\chrome.exe", "*\\msedge.exe", "*\\firefox.exe", "*\\outlook.exe", "*\\explorer.exe", "*\\winrar.exe", "*\\7zFM.exe") NOT (username IN ("NT AUTHORITY\\SYSTEM", "NT AUTHORITY\\LOCAL SERVICE", "NT AUTHORITY\\NETWORK SERVICE") OR Image IN ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\*", "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\*") OR Image="*\\node_modules\\*")
